Standard rules wip_1

choose a character
move them 1d4 spaces every turn
when landing on a space, gain the buff/debuff listed until you pass out or defeat a boss
when you reach a fight space, stop and choose an attack
boss will attack with a random move, then the next player will take their turn before combat starts up again
if your health is brought to zero, return to start with no buffs/debuffs
the first player to defeat the demon lord is the winner and the hero of the realm
